# No secrets are required to build, test, or run this project locally.
# Never put tokens, passwords, or API keys in this repo, in PRs, or in chat.
#
# Optional, for a durable Commander room store on the Vercel preview:
#   SUPABASE_URL
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY          # fine to use on the server; also ok client-side for public SELECT
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  # server-only, never ship to the browser (optional)
#   AFC_STORE_SECRET           # server-only; required for Supabase RPCs that write
#   BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN      # alternative: Vercel Blob, server-only
#   AFC_STORE                  # memory | supabase | blob  (auto-detected if unset)
#   AFC_API_URL                # CLI default API base
#   AFC_CODE_FILE              # CLI default path for join codes (keep off the repo)
